      "description": "Five sentence-case destinations with pale blue selection; an icon rail on tablets and labeled controls on phones.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#today\" class=\"ds-active\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"/><path d=\"M16 2v3\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18\"/><path d=\"M8 13h.01\"/><path d=\"M12 13h.01\"/><path d=\"M16 13h.01\"/><path d=\"M8 17h.01\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/><path d=\"M16 17h.01\"/></svg><span>Today</span></a><a href=\"#notes\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"/><path d=\"M10 9H8\"/><path d=\"M16 13H8\"/><path d=\"M16 17H8\"/></svg><span>Notes</span></a><a href=\"#reminders\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0\"/><path d=\"M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326\"/></svg><span>Reminders</span></a><a href=\"#activity\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"/><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l4 2\"/></svg><span>Activity</span></a><a href=\"#settings\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.671 4.136a2.34 2.34 0 0 1 4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1 2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0 3.831 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.32-1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33-4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0-3.831A2.34 2.34 0 0 1 6.35 6.051a2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319-1.915\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span>Settings</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, Geist),sans-serif;}.ds-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-radius:7px;padding:11px 12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;}.ds-nav svg{flex-shrink:0;}.ds-nav a.ds-active{background:var(--pale);color:var(--blue);}.ds-nav a:hover{background:var(--surface);}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:800px) and (min-width:601px){.ds-nav a{padding:11px;width:max-content;}.ds-nav a>span{display:none;}}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-nav{flex-direction:row;justify-content:space-between;gap:2px;padding:0 12px 10px;}.ds-nav a{flex:1;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;padding:9px 2px;font-size:10px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected Note Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "note-selected",
      "description": "Compact selected note with title, clipped excerpt, and quiet date.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-note ds-selected\" href=\"#editor\" aria-current=\"true\"><h2>A thought worth keeping</h2><p>Start with one clear purpose.</p><time datetime=\"2026-10-05\">Oct 5</time></a>",
      "css": ".ds-note{display:block;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 13px;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--foreground);text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, Geist),sans-serif;}.ds-note:hover{background:var(--surface);}.ds-note.ds-selected{background:var(--pale);}.ds-note h2{margin:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis;}.ds-note p{margin:7px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;}.ds-note time{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:11px;}.ds-note:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Account Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "auth-card",
      "description": "Flat white account container with a neutral stroke and soft corners.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><h1>A little room for you.</h1><p>Open your private workspace.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{width:100%;max-width:460px;background:var(--background);color:var(--foreground);padding:36px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, Geist),sans-serif;}.ds-card h1{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 9px;}.ds-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 27px;}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-card{padding:28px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mio Brand",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "The actual CSS-bar identity beside the Geist wordmark.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-brand\" href=\"#home\" aria-label=\"Mio home\"><span class=\"ds-brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span>Mio</span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:25px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.04em;width:max-content;color:var(--foreground);text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, Geist),sans-serif;}.ds-brand-mark{display:flex;gap:3px;align-items:flex-end;height:22px;}.ds-brand-mark span{width:5px;background:var(--blue);border-radius:2px;height:15px;}.ds-brand-mark span:nth-child(2){height:22px;}.ds-brand:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reminder Schedule Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Exact notification time, full wrapping message, timezone and scheduling state; flat container with explicit edit and cancel controls.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-reminder\"><div class=\"ds-reminder-heading\"><div><time datetime=\"2026-10-07T14:45:00-05:00\">Tomorrow \u00b7 2:45 PM</time><h2>Check my application</h2></div><span class=\"ds-status\">Scheduled</span></div><p class=\"ds-reminder-meta\">Event Tomorrow \u00b7 3:00 PM \u00b7 America/Chicago<br />SMS reminder 15 minutes before</p><div class=\"ds-reminder-actions\"><a href=\"#note\">Open note</a><button class=\"ds-edit\">Edit</button><button class=\"ds-cancel\">Cancel reminder</button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-reminder{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;color:var(--foreground);background:var(--background);font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, Geist),sans-serif;}.ds-reminder-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;}.ds-reminder-heading time{font-size:12px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:550;}.ds-reminder-heading h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:580;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:7px 0 0;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-status{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--surface);padding:5px 8px;border-radius:6px;flex-shrink:0;}.ds-reminder-meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;margin:12px 0 0;}.ds-reminder-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px;}.ds-reminder-actions a{font-size:12px;margin-right:auto;color:var(--blue);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;}.ds-reminder-actions button{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:40px;padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, Geist),sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.2;transition:background .15s,color .15s;cursor:pointer;}.ds-reminder-actions .ds-edit{background:var(--background);color:var(--foreground);border-color:var(--line);}.ds-cancel{background:transparent;color:var(--muted);}.ds-reminder-actions button:hover{background:var(--surface);color:var(--foreground);}.ds-reminder-actions button:focus-visible,.ds-reminder-actions a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-reminder-actions button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:wait;}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-reminder{padding:20px;}.ds-reminder-heading{flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-reminder-actions button{transition:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A private assistant in Messages, with a clear companion",
    "overview": "Mio is a private assistant for people who want to capture thoughts and manage reminders through the Messages app they already use. The landing page explains that workflow and leads invited users to create an account. The companion makes saved information and exact reminder schedules easy to inspect.\n\nThe visual direction keeps Mio\u2019s white canvas, clear blue, three-bar wordmark, and compact navigation. The signature is the transition from a familiar text conversation into a structured note or reminder. That is the one expressive device; surrounding layouts remain quiet.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
